Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:22.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,本期《造物小百科》
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.52,0:00:22.24,Original,,0,0,0,,On how it's made.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝箔
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.24,Original,,0,0,0,,Aluminium foil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:31.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,如何轻松地把三吨重的铝锭变成眼前这片箔?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.96,0:00:31.36,Original,,0,0,0,,How do we get from a three-ton ingot to this in one easy motion?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.18,Translation,,0,0,0,,滑雪板
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.18,Original,,0,0,0,,Snowboards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:44.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,这种混合设计, 其精密程度得益于古老工艺与计算机技术
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.18,0:00:44.16,Original,,0,0,0,,A hybrid design that owes its precision to age-old techniques and computerised technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:49.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,隐形眼镜
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.48,0:00:49.36,Original,,0,0,0,,Contact lenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:54.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,尖端科技遇上金刚石车床, 整个过程快得出奇
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.00,0:00:54.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Cutting-edge science meets diamond-headed lathes in a surprisingly quick process.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:58.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,还有面包
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.44,0:00:58.00,Original,,0,0,0,,And bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,从法棍到圆顶白面包再到贝果,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.56,Original,,0,0,0,,From baguettes to bloomers to bagels,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:04.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,现代面包工厂犹如一场精心编排的交响乐
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.12,0:01:04.72,Original,,0,0,0,,the choreographed symphony which is a modern-day bread factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:12.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝箔成为厨房必备品已有我们无法追忆的年头
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.68,0:01:12.96,Original,,0,0,0,,But first, aluminium foil has been a kitchen standard for longer than we can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:16.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,它是理想的烹饪工具, 因为导热性能极佳
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.44,0:01:16.72,Original,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect cooking tool because it's an ideal heat conductor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:20.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,从烤箱里的烤肉到冰箱冷冻, 用途数不胜数
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.04,0:01:20.88,Original,,0,0,0,,From the roast in the oven to the freezer, it has a myriad of uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,但一块巨大的固态铝是如何
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.00,Original,,0,0,0,,But how does a huge block of solid aluminium get
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,变成薄如纸的箔片?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.24,Original,,0,0,0,,transformed into a paper-thin sheet of foil?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:34.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,制造铝箔需要反复
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.82,0:01:34.16,Original,,0,0,0,,The manufacture of aluminium foil requires the repeated
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:36.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,碾压大块铝锭
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.24,0:01:36.40,Original,,0,0,0,,thinning out of a large block of aluminium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:41.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,这块巨型铝锭的旅程始于天然气熔炉的高温熔炼
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.04,0:01:41.76,Original,,0,0,0,,This massive ingot's journey begins by being blasted in a natural gas furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,熔化这块二十七吨
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.08,Original,,0,0,0,,It takes three to eight hours to melt this twenty-seven
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:48.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,重的铝块需要三到八小时
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.16,0:01:48.00,Original,,0,0,0,,thousand kilo lump of aluminium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:51.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,回炉熔炉的温度高达骇人的
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.72,0:01:51.60,Original,,0,0,0,,The remelting furnace operates at a staggering seven
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,七百五十摄氏度
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.52,Original,,0,0,0,,hundred and fifty degrees centigrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:02:00.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,不能有半点差错, 因为铝的熔点高达六百
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.36,0:02:00.00,Original,,0,0,0,,No chances are taken, because the fusion temperature of aluminium is six hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,六十摄氏度
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.60,Original,,0,0,0,,And sixty degrees centigrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:10.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,取一部分铝液浇入这个小模具, 制成样品
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.88,0:02:10.56,Original,,0,0,0,,A portion of aluminium is poured into this small mould to make a sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:16.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,几秒内便凝固, 样品可用于检测以验证
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.44,0:02:16.32,Original,,0,0,0,,Solidifying in just seconds, the sample allows for testing to verify the contents of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,所配合金的成分
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.04,Original,,0,0,0,,the prepared alloy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来的工序让液态铝
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.60,Original,,0,0,0,,The next encounter takes the now liquid aluminium
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.92,0:02:27.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,经流槽流入出铝井
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.92,0:02:27.68,Original,,0,0,0,,through a trough to the tapping well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:31.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,杂质在专用容器中被过滤掉
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.56,0:02:31.28,Original,,0,0,0,,Any impurities are filtered out in special receptacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:40.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,浇入铸锭模后, 喷水加速冷却过程
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.40,0:02:40.08,Original,,0,0,0,,Poured into ingot moulds, water accelerates the cooling process.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝液随即淬火, 铝锭随之凝固
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.44,Original,,0,0,0,,The molten aluminium is quenched and the ingot solidifies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在重型机械上场了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.12,Original,,0,0,0,,Now the heavy machinery gets to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:58.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,每块铝锭都极为庞大, 长达四点四米
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.64,0:02:58.32,Original,,0,0,0,,Each ingot is massive, measuring four point four metres in length.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,重达惊人的七千五百公斤,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.48,Original,,0,0,0,,It weighs a whopping seven thousand five hundred kilos,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:06.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,必须用行车吊起, 精准地放到
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.80,0:03:06.24,Original,,0,0,0,,so it has to be handled by overhead cranes and placed on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:09.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,专用托板上
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.24,0:03:09.36,Original,,0,0,0,,special plates with absolute precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:13.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,去壳机削去铝锭表层三毫米的厚度
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.76,0:03:13.84,Original,,0,0,0,,The crust removing machines skimmed three millimetres of the ingot's thickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:19.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,这样可消除杂质, 得到完美的镜面效果
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.72,0:03:19.20,Original,,0,0,0,,In doing this, impurities are eliminated to achieve a perfect mirror finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:24.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,冷却去壳刀具的液体痕迹必须全部清除
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.00,0:03:24.40,Original,,0,0,0,,All traces of the liquid used to cool the decrusting knives has to be removed.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.00,0:03:24.40,Annotation,,0,0,0,,去壳刀具：铣削铝锭表层的刀具
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,下一道工序压力最大
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.88,Original,,0,0,0,,The next process is the most stressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.88,0:03:31.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝锭的碾压工序开始了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.88,0:03:31.04,Original,,0,0,0,,The thinning of the ingot begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:34.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝块被热轧辊碾碎
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.76,0:03:34.64,Original,,0,0,0,,The aluminium block is crushed by the hot mill rollers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:40.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,连轧辊本身的温度都在
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.60,0:03:40.32,Original,,0,0,0,,Even the rollers operate at temperatures between four
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:44.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,四百五十五到五百四十摄氏度之间
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.32,0:03:44.00,Original,,0,0,0,,hundred and fifty five and five hundred forty degrees centigrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:48.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,首先要核实施加在铝锭上的压力
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.12,0:03:48.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Firstly, the pressure on the ingot must be verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:52.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,压力过大会使铝锭开裂, 那就得重头再来
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.48,0:03:52.00,Original,,0,0,0,,If too great, it could split this block, and they'd have to start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:57.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,温度太高, 铝锭有粘在轧辊上的风险
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.12,0:03:57.36,Original,,0,0,0,,The heat is so intense that the ingot risks sticking to the mill's roller.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:03:59.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,为此要使用一种润滑剂
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.08,0:03:59.92,Original,,0,0,0,,A lubricant is used to prevent this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:02.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,它含百分之九十五的水和百分之五的油
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.00,0:04:02.64,Original,,0,0,0,,That's ninety five percent water and five percent oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,从四十五厘米的厚度起步,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Starting from a thickness of forty five centimeters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:18.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,每经过一次轧制, 铝锭就变得更薄
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.36,0:04:18.40,Original,,0,0,0,,the ingot becomes increasingly thinner with each pass through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:21.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝板可能需要在
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.20,0:04:21.12,Original,,0,0,0,,The aluminium slab may have to pass through the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:24.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,在碾轧辊之间来回十六次, 才能达到所需厚度
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.12,0:04:24.88,Original,,0,0,0,,crushing rollers sixteen times before the right thickness can be achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:29.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,此时铝锭厚度已达七厘米,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.80,0:04:29.28,Original,,0,0,0,,The ingot now measures seven centimeters in thickness,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:32.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,但还必须压到仅剩半厘米
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.84,0:04:32.24,Original,,0,0,0,,but still it has to get down to just half a centimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:44.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在铝锭厚五厘米, 长度超过九米
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.88,0:04:44.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Now the ingot is five centimeters thick and measures over nine meters in length.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:46.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝板经传送带送往最后的碾轧工序
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.04,0:04:46.24,Original,,0,0,0,,The plate takes its last journey over a conveyor to the final milling stages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:57.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,厚度足以进行卷绕时,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.60,0:04:57.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Sufficiently thin to proceed with spooling,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:01.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝板自身卷绕成完美的圆柱形
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.24,0:05:01.20,Original,,0,0,0,,the plates wrap themselves around to make perfect cylinders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:04.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后被送往冷轧机,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.92,0:05:04.08,Original,,0,0,0,,They're then sent to the cold rolling mill,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:05.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,在那里进一步压薄
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.48,0:05:05.84,Original,,0,0,0,,where they're reduced even further.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:14.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在到了最精细的环节
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.72,0:05:14.48,Original,,0,0,0,,Now comes the most delicate stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:18.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝片已经薄到可能
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.20,0:05:18.16,Original,,0,0,0,,The aluminium sheets have become so thin they risk
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:20.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,因冷轧所需的张力而破裂
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.24,0:05:20.00,Original,,0,0,0,,being broken by the tension needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:24.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,因此将铝片对折, 避免断裂
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.16,0:05:24.32,Original,,0,0,0,,For the cold rolling, so the sheet is doubled to avoid this breakage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:28.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,最后再调整一次轧机设定, 就能得到
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.28,0:05:28.40,Original,,0,0,0,,One last alteration in the mill settings will create a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:32.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,厚度恰好符合厨房级铝箔要求的铝片
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.40,0:05:32.48,Original,,0,0,0,,sheet with exactly the thickness required for kitchen grade aluminium foil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:36.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,为完成整个流程, 箔片两侧
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.20,0:05:36.24,Original,,0,0,0,,To finalise the process, the edges of the foil sheet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:38.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,因受损而皱褶的边缘,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.24,0:05:38.00,Original,,0,0,0,,which have become damaged and crinkled,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:41.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,要用刀具切掉一厘米宽的窄条
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.32,0:05:41.84,Original,,0,0,0,,are removed with a knife that slices a one centimetre thin strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,铝卷被裁成所需的宽度,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.92,Original,,0,0,0,,The roll is cut to the desired width,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:54.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,一块巨型铝锭最终产出的铝箔长达
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.20,0:05:54.16,Original,,0,0,0,,and one huge ingot has produced foil measuring twelve
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:56.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,十二点七公里
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.24,0:05:56.24,Original,,0,0,0,,point seven kilometres in length.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:00.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来, 看看行家的装备
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.32,0:06:00.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Next up, the tools of the trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:01.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,对滑雪板玩家而言,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.64,0:06:01.44,Original,,0,0,0,,For snowboarders,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:07.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,就像所有优雅的运动, 看似轻松实则不易
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.00,0:06:07.52,Original,,0,0,0,,like all graceful sports, nothing is as easy as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:11.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,制造这些流线型的装备同样如此
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.08,0:06:11.20,Original,,0,0,0,,The same can be said for manufacturing these sleek pieces of kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:17.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,高手或许知道顶级滑雪板如何制成, 那其他人呢?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.52,0:06:17.52,Original,,0,0,0,,The pros may know how the best boards are produced, but what about everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:20.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,这里有一份滑雪板制作的内部指南
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.16,0:06:20.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Here's an insider's guide to making snowboards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:32.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,滑雪板是冬季运动爱好者的挚爱
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.76,0:06:32.80,Original,,0,0,0,,The snowboard is the delight of winter sports enthusiasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:36.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,核心结构就是一块简单的薄木板
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.44,0:06:36.00,Original,,0,0,0,,At its core, it's a simple thin sheet of wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:40.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,根据所制板的类型, 可选用多种木材
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.56,0:06:40.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Various types can be used depending on the style of the board being made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:46.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,固定器必须牢牢装在板上,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.24,0:06:46.48,Original,,0,0,0,,Bindings have to be firmly attached to the board,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:50.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,所以要钻孔装入预埋件, 固定器将固定其上
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.20,0:06:50.56,Original,,0,0,0,,so holes are drilled for inserts to which the bindings will be secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:53.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,模板可确保钻孔精准
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.20,0:06:53.20,Original,,0,0,0,,A template allows for precise drilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:07:00.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,厚板可能过硬, 所以宽度至关重要
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.58,0:07:00.16,Original,,0,0,0,,A thick board can be too rigid, so width is all important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:03.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,刨削使板材达到所需厚度
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.96,0:07:03.36,Original,,0,0,0,,Planing reduces the board to the required depth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:11.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后一道成型工序精修板的轮廓
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.80,0:07:11.84,Original,,0,0,0,,A shaping procedure then refines the board's contours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:16.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,此刻板材仍完全平整, 没有任何弧度
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.40,0:07:16.40,Original,,0,0,0,,At this point, the board is still perfectly flat with no curvature at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,板材须竖直存放, 等待下一道工序
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.28,Original,,0,0,0,,The boards have to be stored upright to await their next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:35.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在要固定嵌入木中的铝制预埋件
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.60,0:07:35.36,Original,,0,0,0,,Now, aluminium inserts must be secured, which are embedded in the wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:39.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,这层薄薄的玻璃纤维能更好地支撑预埋件
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.24,0:07:39.52,Original,,0,0,0,,This thin sheet of fiberglass affords better support for the inserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:51.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,尚未成型的板材被夹在工作台上,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.14,0:07:51.68,Original,,0,0,0,,The still embryonic board is clamped to a bench,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:53.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,以便进行精细加工
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.76,0:07:53.76,Original,,0,0,0,,enabling precision work to be carried out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:08:00.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,涂上环氧树脂这种粘性极强的胶水
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.04,0:08:00.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Epoxy, an extremely strong adhesive, is applied.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,在室温下涂覆到玻璃纤维上
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.68,Original,,0,0,0,,to the fiberglass at room temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:07.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后必须除去多余的环氧树脂, 并消除所有气泡
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.20,0:08:07.36,Original,,0,0,0,,It's then essential to remove any excess epoxy and to eliminate all air bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:19.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,板面由坚韧的塑料制成,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.64,0:08:19.52,Original,,0,0,0,,The top part of the board is made of a resistant plastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:22.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,采用巧妙的丝网印刷工艺涂覆
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.08,0:08:22.88,Original,,0,0,0,,applied by an ingenious silk screen process.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:29.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后, 一把小刮板把底色油墨均匀刮涂在板上
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.44,0:08:29.68,Original,,0,0,0,,Then, a small squeegee spreads a coat of the base colour ink evenly across the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:32.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,每次涂刷称为一遍
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.48,0:08:32.48,Original,,0,0,0,,Each application is called a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,颜色必须一种一种地加
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.80,Original,,0,0,0,,Colours have to be added one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在板材需要固化
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Now, the board must be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:40.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,将施以极大压力
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.40,0:08:40.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Extreme pressures will be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:43.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,模具闭合时, 板材被压出所需的弧度
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.64,0:08:43.52,Original,,0,0,0,,When the mould is closed, the board is given the desired curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:48.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,模具产生的热量使板上的环氧树脂固化变硬
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.48,0:08:48.72,Original,,0,0,0,,Heat generated from the mould makes the epoxy on the board set and harden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:57.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在板材已成所需形状, 从模具中取出,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.88,0:08:57.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Now the right shape, the board is removed from the mould,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:09:01.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,多余的环氧树脂和木料用带锯切掉
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.08,0:09:01.36,Original,,0,0,0,,and any excess epoxy and wood are removed by a bandsaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:04.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,为切出漂亮利落的边缘,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.56,0:09:04.32,Original,,0,0,0,,To achieve a beautifully clean cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:07.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,锯条每切五十块板就更换一次
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.56,0:09:07.04,Original,,0,0,0,,the saw blade is changed after every fifty boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,这是高精度的活, 由人工完成
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.80,Original,,0,0,0,,It's highly precise work and carried out manually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:25.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后丝网印刷机再次登场,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.70,0:09:25.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the silk screen press is brought into action again,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:28.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,这次涂上另一种颜色——红色
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.60,0:09:28.56,Original,,0,0,0,,as it applies another colour, this time the red.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:48.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在要给滑雪板加上保护层
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.16,0:09:48.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Now the snowboard must be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:52.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,一层极薄的清漆喷淋将形成坚固的保护膜
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.64,0:09:52.00,Original,,0,0,0,,An ultra thin shower of varnish will form a hardened shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,板材从这道幕帘下穿过,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.40,Original,,0,0,0,,The board passes beneath this curtain,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:57.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后进入烘干机, 待上六小时
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.88,0:09:57.28,Original,,0,0,0,,and then moves into a dryer for a six hour stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:05.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,砂磨去除板缘多余的清漆
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.48,0:10:05.60,Original,,0,0,0,,Sanding removes surplus varnish from the edges of the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:09.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,在板上重新钻孔, 以对准
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.44,0:10:09.60,Original,,0,0,0,,New holes are pierced into the board to locate the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:11.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,生产初期安装的预埋件
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.60,0:10:11.92,Original,,0,0,0,,inserts installed at the beginning of production.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:18.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台砂光机去除固化
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.76,0:10:18.08,Original,,0,0,0,,This sander removes imperfections in the hardened
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:21.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,清漆上的瑕疵, 为第二次涂漆做准备
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.08,0:10:21.36,Original,,0,0,0,,varnish and prepares the board for its second varnish coating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:25.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后砂磨塑料板底, 得到理想的光洁度
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.32,0:10:25.68,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the plastic base is sanded to obtain the desired finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:31.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,板材经过检查, 用刀片验证各涂层
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.76,0:10:31.68,Original,,0,0,0,,The board is checked, and a razor blade verifies that the different coats are
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:32.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,之间粘合良好
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.76,0:10:32.88,Original,,0,0,0,,well adhered to one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:37.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,为增添奢华质感, 部分板材还嵌有蚀刻铝饰片
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.92,0:10:37.68,Original,,0,0,0,,For a luxury touch, selected boards get an engraved aluminium insert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:40.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,至此, 滑雪板终于可以上场了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.24,0:10:40.32,Original,,0,0,0,,The board is now finally ready for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:45.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,这家工厂每天生产超过五百块
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.56,0:10:45.44,Original,,0,0,0,,With over 500 snowboards in 30 different models
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:49.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,三十种不同型号的滑雪板, 为玩家提供
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.44,0:10:49.68,Original,,0,0,0,,produced each day, this factory offers the snowboarder the tools to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:50.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,施展技艺的工具
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.68,0:10:50.88,Original,,0,0,0,,express their skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,《造物小百科》接下来播出:
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.72,Original,,0,0,0,,Coming up on How It's Made:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:11:01.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,隐形眼镜, 从太空时代的新奇之物到二十年间
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.00,0:11:01.92,Original,,0,0,0,,contact lenses from space age and exotic to everyday
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:03.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,人人可用的日常用品
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.92,0:11:03.76,Original,,0,0,0,,acceptance in just 20 years
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:06.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,还有从法棍到圆顶白面包的面包,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.18,0:11:06.56,Original,,0,0,0,,and bread from baguettes to bloomers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,现代面包工厂犹如一场精心编排的交响乐
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.16,Original,,0,0,0,,the choreographed symphony of a modern day bread factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:12.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,广告之后再见
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.64,0:11:12.16,Original,,0,0,0,,See you after the break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:22.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,欢迎回到《造物小百科》
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.52,0:11:22.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to How It's Made.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:27.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,稍后我们看看平凡的面包在上架超市之前
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.80,0:11:27.60,Original,,0,0,0,,Later we look at what goes into the humble loaf before
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:30.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,经历了什么, 但首先,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.60,0:11:30.48,Original,,0,0,0,,it reaches the supermarket shelves, but first,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:37.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,二十年前它们还被视作太空时代的新奇之物, 如今已是日常用品
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.32,0:11:37.52,Original,,0,0,0,,20 years ago they were seen as space age and exotic, now they are an everyday item.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,胆小者仍难以想象将
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.36,Original,,0,0,0,,The squeamish among us still couldn't imagine having
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:43.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,一样东西如此贴近我们的眼睛,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.36,0:11:43.84,Original,,0,0,0,,something so closely located to our eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:47.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,但隐形眼镜彻底改变了人们看待
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.04,0:11:47.84,Original,,0,0,0,,but contact lenses have revolutionised the way people
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:49.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,自己的方式, 名副其实
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.84,0:11:49.84,Original,,0,0,0,,see themselves, quite literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:56.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,隐形眼镜已问世一百多年
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.88,0:11:56.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Contact lenses have been in existence for over a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:12:00.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,起初完全坚硬, 如今已变得如明胶般柔软
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.56,0:12:00.48,Original,,0,0,0,,At first completely rigid, they have become as flexible as gelatine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:07.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些小圆片用于制作各种颜色的软性聚合物隐形眼镜
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.08,0:12:07.20,Original,,0,0,0,,These small discs are used to make soft polymer contact lenses in a variety of colours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:11.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,当然, 一切从患者的验光单开始,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.72,0:12:11.68,Original,,0,0,0,,Of course, the place to start is with a patient's prescription,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.84,0:12:14.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,数字化之后, 整个流程得以启动
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.84,0:12:14.08,Original,,0,0,0,,which has been digitised for the process to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:18.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,第一步是先对镜片成型进行数据处理控制
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.12,0:12:18.72,Original,,0,0,0,,The first stage begins with the data processing control of the shaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:23.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,车床开始加工镜片的内曲面,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.56,0:12:23.52,Original,,0,0,0,,The lathe commences by shaping the inner curvature of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:27.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,转速达每分钟六千转
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.60,0:12:27.36,Original,,0,0,0,,the lens, rotating at 6,000 revolutions per minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:29.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,它配备了一颗工业金刚石
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.68,0:12:29.52,Original,,0,0,0,,It's armed with an industrial diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:33.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,它加工内表面, 即接触角膜的部分
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.00,0:12:33.12,Original,,0,0,0,,It shapes the inner surface, the part that touches the cornea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:37.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,圆片不能有任何瑕疵, 随后
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.64,0:12:37.68,Original,,0,0,0,,The disc must be free from any imperfection and is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,用极细的研磨膏抛光
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.84,Original,,0,0,0,,polished with a super fine abrasive paste.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:44.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,抛光至关重要, 因为它能保证
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.04,0:12:44.08,Original,,0,0,0,,Polishing is an essential step because it guarantees
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:45.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,佩戴舒适, 视力清晰
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.16,0:12:45.92,Original,,0,0,0,,excellent comfort and perfect vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:54.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,技术员用极其精密的量具测量镜片厚度
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.40,0:12:54.32,Original,,0,0,0,,A technician measures lens thickness with an extremely precise gauge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:58.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,接着加工外表面,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.72,0:12:58.48,Original,,0,0,0,,The outer surface is then shaped,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,即接触眼睑的部分
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.16,Original,,0,0,0,,the part which touches the eyelid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:04.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,镜片用一种特殊蜡粘在旋转臂上,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.44,0:13:04.72,Original,,0,0,0,,The lens is glued to a spinning arm with a special wax,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:07.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,之后用超声波装置去除
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.96,0:13:07.52,Original,,0,0,0,,which will be removed later by an ultrasound device.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:15.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,蜡在几秒内塑造成型
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.36,0:13:15.76,Original,,0,0,0,,The wax is moulded in just seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:37.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在加工镜片的外径, 由
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.04,0:13:37.76,Original,,0,0,0,,The outer diameter of the lens is now shaped as the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:42.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,计算机控制的机械臂轻松切掉多余的聚合物并抛光
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.84,0:13:42.88,Original,,0,0,0,,computer-controlled arm effortlessly cuts away the excess polymer and is polished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:50.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,这种高速进行的抛光
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.32,0:13:50.88,Original,,0,0,0,,This polishing, done at high speed, calls for an abrasive paste,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,需要研磨膏、一些油和一个小棉球
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.20,Original,,0,0,0,,some oil, and a small polyester cotton-like ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:01.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台设备一次抛光多片镜片,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.48,0:14:01.04,Original,,0,0,0,,This apparatus polishes several lenses at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:03.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,整个过程仅需六十秒
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.60,0:14:03.68,Original,,0,0,0,,a step that takes only 60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:13.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后技术员打磨镜片边缘
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.04,0:14:13.84,Original,,0,0,0,,A technician then polishes the rims of the lenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:27.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,聚合物随后水化, 使其变得柔软
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.56,0:14:27.36,Original,,0,0,0,,The polymer is then hydrated to make it flexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:29.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,镜片需浸泡在酸碱度平衡的
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.00,0:14:29.92,Original,,0,0,0,,Lenses remain immersed in a balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:32.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,生理盐水中二十四小时
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.00,0:14:32.48,Original,,0,0,0,,pH saline solution for 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:36.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,镜片吸饱液体后膨胀,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.44,0:14:36.56,Original,,0,0,0,,The lens becomes engorged with liquid and expands,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:38.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,达到所需尺寸
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.80,0:14:38.48,Original,,0,0,0,,reaching the desired proportions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:52.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来检查镜片
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.92,0:14:52.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Next, the lenses checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,用光学地形图仪验证
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.24,Original,,0,0,0,,An optical topographer is used to verify whether the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:59.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,镜片光焦度的分布是否足够精确
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.24,0:14:59.16,Original,,0,0,0,,spread of the optical power in the lens is precise enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:10.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,每一步, 这些柔软易碎的镜片都必须加倍小心地拿放
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.04,0:15:10.68,Original,,0,0,0,,At every step, the soft, fragile lenses must be handled with the greatest of care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台称作焦度计的装置
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.96,Original,,0,0,0,,This unit, called a fronto focal meter,
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.64,0:15:19.14,Annotation,,0,0,0,,焦度计：测量镜片屈光度的仪器
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:22.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,是一种计量设备, 用于验证镜片的光学精度
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.52,0:15:22.28,Original,,0,0,0,,is a metering device which verifies the optical precision of the lens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:32.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,镜片至此制作完成, 经清洗后
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.52,0:15:32.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Lenses are now completed and are cleaned,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:36.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,放入装有盐溶液的容器中储存
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.48,0:15:36.12,Original,,0,0,0,,then stored in containers filled with salt solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:45.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,药瓶用硅胶盖和铝盖严密封口
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.92,0:15:45.24,Original,,0,0,0,,The vials are perfectly sealed with a silicon cap and another of aluminium.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.24,0:15:51.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后放入灭菌器, 在
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.24,0:15:51.72,Original,,0,0,0,,Then they are placed in a sterilizer at a temperature
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:55.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,一百二十一摄氏度的温度下加热一个半小时
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.80,0:15:55.00,Original,,0,0,0,,of 121 degrees centigrade for an hour and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:59.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,令人惊叹的是, 若不开封, 内容物可保持无菌
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.44,0:15:59.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Amazingly, the contents will remain sterile for a period of up to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:01.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,长达七年
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.88,0:16:01.56,Original,,0,0,0,,seven years if not opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:05.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,虽然制作一片镜片需经过十四道工序,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.52,0:16:05.56,Original,,0,0,0,,Although the production of a lens involves 14 steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,但若不计水化过程,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.64,Original,,0,0,0,,if you exclude the hydration process,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:10.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,十五分钟就能做出一片
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.12,0:16:10.44,Original,,0,0,0,,it only takes 15 minutes to make one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:13.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,从这些简单的彩色圆片,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.24,0:16:13.16,Original,,0,0,0,,From these simple colored discs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:19.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,一件精心打造的高精度科技产品就能瞬间改变一个人的生活
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.24,0:16:19.16,Original,,0,0,0,,a crafted precision piece of technology can transform a person's life instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:24.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,法棍、恰巴塔、皮塔饼、切片白面包、圆顶白面包,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.16,0:16:24.84,Original,,0,0,0,,Baguette, ciabatta, pita, white slice, bloomer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,贝果、全麦黑麦、黑麦粗面包
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.76,Original,,0,0,0,,bagel, wholemeal rye, pumpernickel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:31.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,种类无穷无尽, 面包的名声亦如此
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.48,0:16:31.00,Original,,0,0,0,,The list is endless, as is the bread's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:34.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,就连古埃及人和古希腊人都是烘焙大师,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.84,0:16:34.40,Original,,0,0,0,,Even the Egyptians and Greeks were master bakers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:37.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,但他们会对现代面包工厂
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.28,0:16:37.92,Original,,0,0,0,,but how would they react to the choreographed symphony
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,这场精心编排的交响乐作何感想?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.92,Original,,0,0,0,,that is the modern day bread factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:46.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,在工厂规模上制作面包, 绝非一件可以掉以轻心的差事
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.76,0:16:46.16,Original,,0,0,0,,The art of bread making on a factory scale is a job not to be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.72,0:16:49.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,需要希斯·罗宾逊式的奇思妙想, 才能让所有
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.72,0:16:49.60,Original,,0,0,0,,It takes Heath Robinson-like imagination to make all
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.72,0:16:51.47,Annotation,,0,0,0,,希斯·罗宾逊：英国漫画家，常画复杂机械
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:52.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,传送带、滑轮和刀具协同运作
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.60,0:16:52.64,Original,,0,0,0,,the conveyors, pulleys and knives to work in tandem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:56.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,整个流程从六千公斤面粉开始
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.68,0:16:56.96,Original,,0,0,0,,The journey starts with six thousand kilos of flour
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:16:59.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,从防护格栅倒入
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.20,0:16:59.04,Original,,0,0,0,,being poured through a protective grill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:04.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,在加入原料前, 面粉先储存在三十六个巨型容器中
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.92,0:17:04.56,Original,,0,0,0,,Thirty-six enormous containers store the flour before the ingredients are added.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:13.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些揉面槽花三小时发酵酵母,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.32,0:17:13.20,Original,,0,0,0,,For three hours, these kneading troughs ferment the yeast,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:14.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,面团最终将在此发酵膨胀
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.36,0:17:14.88,Original,,0,0,0,,where the dough will eventually rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:29.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,利用时机与蛮力的结合,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.16,0:17:29.20,Original,,0,0,0,,Using a combination of timing and brute force,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:32.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台巨型搅拌机揉面八分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.52,0:17:32.48,Original,,0,0,0,,this huge mixer kneads the dough for eight minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:46.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,重达惊人的一千公斤,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.68,0:17:46.08,Original,,0,0,0,,Weighing a whopping one thousand kilos,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:48.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,面团被倒入一个大桶
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.24,0:17:48.48,Original,,0,0,0,,the contents are emptied into a large tub.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:57.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,面团被倾倒到一个滑送系统上
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.32,0:17:57.04,Original,,0,0,0,,The dough is emptied onto a slide system.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:06.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,机器底部的小孔让面团流出
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.66,0:18:06.24,Original,,0,0,0,,A small hole at the bottom of the machine allows the dough to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:11.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后, 两只机械臂把面团切成面包大小的面团块
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.88,0:18:11.60,Original,,0,0,0,,Then, two mechanically operated arms cut the dough into loaf-sized pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:16.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,传送带接着把面团送往下一站
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.40,0:18:16.96,Original,,0,0,0,,One of many conveyor systems then transports the dough onto its next destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:25.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,在这里, 面团块被搓成圆球, 更便于加工
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.44,0:18:25.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Here, dough pieces are rolled into balls, which can be more easily worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:32.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,面团球随后撒上面粉, 防止它们在
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.24,0:18:32.64,Original,,0,0,0,,The dough balls are then floured to prevent them from
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:35.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,运输和成型过程中相互粘连
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.72,0:18:35.12,Original,,0,0,0,,sticking during their transportation and when they're molded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,运输途中面团得以静置, 让酵母发挥作用
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.76,Original,,0,0,0,,During transport, the dough can rest, allowing the yeast to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:51.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,面团随后被折叠并卷起
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.60,0:18:51.28,Original,,0,0,0,,The dough is then folded and rolled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机器每秒可处理三个,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.92,Original,,0,0,0,,The machine can handle three per second,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:57.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,每小时总量达一万一千五百个
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.16,0:18:57.52,Original,,0,0,0,,for a total of eleven thousand five hundred an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:03.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,面团被擀成恰好一条面包的大小, 落入烤模
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.20,0:19:03.28,Original,,0,0,0,,The dough is rolled out to the exact loaf size and falls into baking molds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:10.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机器用来制作热狗面包
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.52,0:19:10.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Different-sized holes on this machine mean hot dog rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:16.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些小面团球须先纵向整形并发酵, 才能入模
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.84,0:19:16.32,Original,,0,0,0,,These little dough balls have to be shaped lengthwise and fermented before molding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:33.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,热狗面包以完美的对称被机械塑形
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.84,0:19:33.28,Original,,0,0,0,,In perfect symmetry, the hot dog rolls are mechanically shaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:36.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,面团块之间不能相互接触,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.72,0:19:36.72,Original,,0,0,0,,Dough pieces must not touch one another,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:39.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,所以由一只小机械臂将它们隔开
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.20,0:19:39.84,Original,,0,0,0,,so they're spaced apart by a small mechanical arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:46.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,回到面包房, 下一道工序开始了
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.96,0:19:46.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Back at the loaf bakery, the next step is starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:49.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,面团块卧在烤模底部,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.76,0:19:49.52,Original,,0,0,0,,Squatted down at the bottom of the molds,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,进入醒发箱,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.60,Original,,0,0,0,,the dough pieces go into the proofer,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:54.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,在四十二摄氏度
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.24,0:19:54.72,Original,,0,0,0,,where they rise for an hour at forty-two degrees
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,百分之七十湿度的环境中发酵一小时
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.20,Original,,0,0,0,,centigrade and at seventy percent humidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后在二百五十五摄氏度
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Then they bake for twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:02.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,的温度下烘烤二十分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.00,0:20:02.40,Original,,0,0,0,,minutes at two hundred and fifty five degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:06.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,烤好后, 面包呈金黄颜色
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.16,0:20:06.88,Original,,0,0,0,,When finally baked, the loaves are a golden colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:09.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后传送带再次接管
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.52,0:20:09.20,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the conveyors take over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:12.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,真空系统把面包从模具中吸出
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.76,0:20:12.72,Original,,0,0,0,,A vacuum system draws the loaves from their molds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:15.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,接着放到另一条传送带上冷却
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.20,0:20:15.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Then they're placed on another conveyor to cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:34.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,引导系统负责把面包送往面包房各处
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.92,0:20:34.64,Original,,0,0,0,,A guidance system takes care of carrying the breads to various sections of the bakery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,冷却充分后, 面包进入切片机
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.84,Original,,0,0,0,,When well cooled, breads go to the slicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:42.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,它每分钟能切六十五条面包
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.16,0:20:42.40,Original,,0,0,0,,Which cuts sixty five loaves a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:46.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,它们由两厘米宽、四十
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.20,0:20:46.16,Original,,0,0,0,,They are sliced by two centimetre wide and forty
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:48.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,厘米长的钢锯条切片
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.16,0:20:48.40,Original,,0,0,0,,centimetre long steel saw blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:52.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,机器随后把面包快速送往最后
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.00,0:20:52.72,Original,,0,0,0,,The machines then speed the loaves onto their last
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:57.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,工序——包装, 在这里以每分钟六十五条的速率自动包装
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.72,0:20:57.92,Original,,0,0,0,,stage, packaging, where they are automatically packed at sixty five per minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:08.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在可以装运出厂了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.72,0:21:08.56,Original,,0,0,0,,They're now ready for shipping.
